OL,3,AWhy the 'Temu Range Rover' is such a
OL,4,Athreat to Jaguar Land Rover
OL,5,
OL,6,FJaguar Land Rover's decision to shed
OL,7,F4,000 jobs comes after the carmaker has
OL,8,Ftravelled down a very rough road.
OL,10,FThe company has seen sales fall in all
OL,11,Fof its major markets and has been
OL,12,Fdealing with the consequences of a
OL,13,Fdevastating cyber-attack that paralysed
OL,14,Fproduction last year.
OL,16,FAt the same time, it has invested
OL,17,Fbillions in an effort to reinvent
OL,18,Fitself for an electric future, in which
OL,19,Fit is likely to face intense
OL,20,Fcompetition from aggressively expanding
OL,21,FChinese brands.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
